      "title": "ICMPv6: handle field overloading by MRD",
      "message": "ICMPv6: handle field overloading by MRD\n\nRFC 4286 defines the code field of the ICMPv6 packet as advertisement\ninterval or reserved. Handle these special cases.\n\nFixes #20911\n",
      "author_name": "Jaap Keuter",
